  "description": "For those seeking the pinnacle of comfort and style, our Penthouse apartments offer an exceptional living experience. Located on the top floor, these premium studios boast stunning panoramic views across the city skyline. \n\nAlongside thoughtfully designed interiors, residents enjoy exclusive access to the 6th floor lounges—perfect for relaxing or entertaining in an elevated setting.\n\nThe Penthouse combines luxury, convenience, and breath-taking views for a truly refined co-living experience.\n\n***All bills are included ***\nHeating\nElectricity\nWIFI\nWater\n\n***Development Features***\n24/7 Concierge\nGym (classes included) \nYoga Studio\nCinema\nGames room \nRoof top terrace with panoramic views \nCo-working spaces\nBookable Meeting Room\nComplimentary Social events \nCafé onsite\nBicycle parking\nAccess via Key Fob\nCCTV\n\nThis exclusive co-living development is the largest of its kind in Dublin City and is located in the heart of The Liberties - one of Dublin’s most vibrant neighbourhoods. \n\nLiberties House is within walking distance to the City Centre and has excellent transport connections, including Luas, local buses, Dublin bike, Bleeperbike and GoCar. \n\nWe look forward to welcoming you to Liberties House and joining our community.",
